s ?) causes the issue.\n\nMy issue comes out when I try to map two enum properties to each other. This happens even when the same type of enum is used, or when I try to map with .UseValue(MyEnum.MyValue).\n\nThe workarounds I found are either to change the type of one of the property from enum to an int, or to ignore the value and map it manually (target.MyProperty = source.MyProperty).\n\nThere seem to be an infinite loop with « GetCustomAttributes », but I can't figure why this happens. As I said, I could not reproduce on a smaller project, and I already tried for a few hours.\n\nHowever, what I can do if you are interested is to try to understand the issue with you (I'm willing to spend some time on Skype even, if you want), as I have the reproduction case on my main project with unit tests (so I can also check if the issue is resolved, or help diagnose it).\n\nThis is completely non-blocking now (I have a few workarounds), so I'm just here to help for this issue, I'm not seeking support from you.\n","closed_by":{"login":"PaulARoy","id":6310023,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTAwMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6310023?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy","html_url":"https://github.com/PaulARoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PaulARoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.githu